                                              
  Help                                        
                                              
  j/k or ↑/↓   move through sessions          
  Enter        open the selected session      
  ctrl+x n     start a new session            
  ctrl+x l     show all sessions              
  ctrl+p       open commands                  
  ?            show this help                 
  ctrl+c       quit the hub                   
  Home: type a prompt · Tab selects Agent/P…  
  New session: ↑/↓ field · ←/→ choose Agent…  
  Chat: i message · a image path · Tab edit…  
  Chat: ctrl+x a/m/e settings · c Copy · f …  
  Chat: click image or o opens hovered image  
  Chat: j/k scroll · ctrl+] back to sessions  
  Images use text placeholders; Enter/o ope…  
                                              